      "color": "orange",
      "text": "Sidebar. A macOS app: a source-list sidebar with this page's sections and a watchlist, inset grouped lists.\n\nLayout: Two panes: a 290-px source list, and a content pane with a toolbar, inset grouped lists and charts.\nThe memorable thing: The sidebar: coloured squircle section icons over a live watchlist, like Finder meets Stocks.\nType: Manrope 800 for titles, 500–700 for lists and text; sizes follow macOS (13–17 px lists, 46 px titles).\nLight: bg #FFFFFF, surf #F5F5F7, ink #1D1D1F, muted #6E6E73, acc #D70F44, line #E0E0E6\nDark: bg #1E1E20, surf #28282B, ink #F5F5F7, muted #9C9CA3, acc #FF375F, line #3B3B40\nMagnet rail on the right edge. Live prices on these boards are NSE closing prices from 25 Sep 2026; every chart is drawn from real data or the project's pricer."
    }
